<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: cornlauncher -->
  <VV_Cornlauncher.label>玉米炮手</VV_Cornlauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: It is a arcane plant that detects nearby enemies and attacks by launching corn. It consumes mana each time it fires, and the launched corn explodes upon impact, scattering corn kernels around, which then explode on a smaller scale. It works well against many enemies, but the explosion can also hurt allies. -->
  <VV_Cornlauncher.description>一種神秘植物，可以偵測附近的敵人并發射玉米進行攻擊。每次發射都會消耗魔能，其發射的玉米棒在撞擊時會發生爆炸，將玉米粒撒在周圍，玉米粒又會在較小的范圍內爆炸。\n\n它能對許多敵人都很有效，但爆炸也會傷及盟友。如果受損，玉米炮手可能會爆炸，因此需要小心放置。</VV_Cornlauncher.description>
  
